  'E-Mail-Vorlage speichern': 'Save email template',
  'Legt eine E-Mail-Vorlage an (ohne id) oder ändert sie. Entweder body (Text oder HTML mit is_html) oder design (Builder-JSON: {settings: {width, background, contentBackground, fontFamily, textColor, linkColor, fontSize, preheader}, sections: [{columns: [{blocks: [{type: heading|text|image|button|divider|spacer|social|video|html|footer, props, style}]}], widths}]}) oder starter (Schlüssel aus ghl_list_email_templates → starters) als Ausgangspunkt. Text-Blöcke: **fett**, *kursiv*, [Link](https://…), Listen mit "- ". Platzhalter wie {{contact.first_name|du}} bleiben erhalten; das HTML rendert der Server.': 'Creates an email template (without id) or updates it. Either body (text, or HTML with is_html) or design (builder JSON: {settings: {width, background, contentBackground, fontFamily, textColor, linkColor, fontSize, preheader}, sections: [{columns: [{blocks: [{type: heading|text|image|button|divider|spacer|social|video|html|footer, props, style}]}], widths}]}) or starter (a key from ghl_list_email_templates → starters) as the starting point. Text blocks: **bold**, *italic*, [link](https://…), lists with "- ". Placeholders such as {{contact.first_name|there}} are kept; the server renders the HTML.',
